WEBVTT

00:00:01.909 --> 00:00:04.170
Job hunting is a lot to keep track of.

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:07.291
JobCairn puts your whole search in one place.

00:00:07.911 --> 00:00:09.214
Setup takes a minute.

00:00:09.254 --> 00:00:10.680
Answer a few questions,

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.730
or start from your resume.

00:00:13.527 --> 00:00:16.501
Everything stays in one folder on your computer.

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:18.624
Private papers stay locked.

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:20.770
Ask Claude to find jobs.

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:23.432
It searches the job boards in your own Chrome,

00:00:23.472 --> 00:00:24.917
the way you would.

00:00:25.572 --> 00:00:26.965
Every search is logged,

00:00:27.005 --> 00:00:29.283
with a report of what it found.

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:31.601
Each job lands in one table,

00:00:31.641 --> 00:00:32.536
scored for fit.

00:00:32.576 --> 00:00:35.408
Ads that offer sponsorship go to the top.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:38.183
Open a job to read the whole ad,

00:00:38.223 --> 00:00:40.160
the score, and your gaps.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.589
Company research gathers what is known about each

00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:46.194
employer, including past sponsorship.

00:00:47.155 --> 00:00:48.511
When a job is worth it,

00:00:48.551 --> 00:00:51.128
Claude tailors your resume and cover letter.

00:00:51.168 --> 00:00:53.852
Every line comes from your own history.

00:00:54.473 --> 00:00:56.726
Choose a template in Resume Studio,

00:00:56.766 --> 00:00:59.300
then export a PDF or a Word file.

00:01:00.127 --> 00:01:02.367
Mail files each reply under its job.

00:01:02.407 --> 00:01:05.279
Write with Claude drafts your follow-up.

00:01:06.246 --> 00:01:09.063
Nothing is sent until you approve it.

00:01:10.032 --> 00:01:12.411
Learn turns your gaps into short guides,

00:01:12.451 --> 00:01:14.643
practice questions and videos.

00:01:15.227 --> 00:01:17.359
Home shows where everything stands.

00:01:17.399 --> 00:01:18.324
Drop in a file,

00:01:18.364 --> 00:01:20.738
and JobCairn suggests where it belongs.

00:01:20.778 --> 00:01:22.487
Delete something by mistake?

00:01:22.527 --> 00:01:23.261
Undo.

00:01:25.439 --> 00:01:26.095
JobCairn.

00:01:26.135 --> 00:01:27.279
Your job search,

00:01:27.319 --> 00:01:28.656
in one place.

